# Anything written about a real workbook – never commit. A mapping file
# holds the original values outright; a manifest from inspect_excel.py
# holds the sheet names and the range names, and those are written by
# hand and say what the file is about. No JSON in this repo is meant to
# be tracked, so the rule is the whole extension.
*.json

# Generated and anonymized output files
*.xlsx

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
